# min16float, min16int, min16uint, min10float and half without 16-bit types: 32-bit storage and arithmetic, relaxed precision on SPIR-V.
# The constant buffer is Gain, Bias, Count, pad, Pair (16-byte aligned).
case types_min_precision
shader types/min_precision.hlsl
relaxed
dispatch CSMain 1 1 1
uniform 0 0 : 0.75 0.5 7i 0u 1.5 -0.25
storage 0 1 : @f01(2,192)
storage 0 2 out size=768
storage 0 3 out size=256
